sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin
  participant F as Frontend(Admin)
  participant B as Backend
  participant DB as Supabase/Postgres

  A->>F: Open Products (Admin dashboard)
  F->>B: GET /admin/products (x-admin-api-key)
  B->>DB: SELECT * FROM products
  DB-->>B: returns rows
  B-->>F: products JSON
  F-->>A: render list

  A->>F: Click Create product
  F->>B: POST /admin/products {id,name,price}
  B->>DB: UPSERT products
  DB-->>B: OK
  B-->>F: created
  F-->>A: show success

  A->>F: Click Delete
  F->>B: DELETE /admin/products/:id
  B->>DB: DELETE FROM products WHERE id=...
  DB-->>B: OK
  B-->>F: ok
  F-->>A: removed
